```
> This expression has type Map[_/0, _/1], its value cannot be implicitly ignored (hint: use `ignore(...)` or `let _ = ...` to explicitly ignore it).

You can work around it like this:
```moonbit
match foo {
  A | B | C => return
  _ => {
    () // all good now, parsed as a block not a struct literal
  }
}
```

